    - Minimization problem (global optimum at x=0)
    - Search space: [-5.0, 5.0] per dimension
    - NOT Basins: Basin sizes vary from ~4 units to <0.1 units across dimensions
    - Separable: F(x) = Σ f_i(x_i) with no cross-dimensional coupling
    """

